      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 752,
        "content": "## Find LinkedIn sales leads with Apify and save them to Google Sheets\n\n### Who's it for\n\nFounders, growth marketers, and sales teams who want a repeatable way to build a targeted LinkedIn prospect list without paying an agency or spending hours on manual research.\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow manually starts a LinkedIn lead generation run, searches for LinkedIn profiles via Apify, and aggregates the discovered profile URLs. It then sends those URLs to another Apify step to enrich the profiles with email data and appends the resulting leads to Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure Apify credentials in n8n and set the LinkedIn profile search actor/input parameters in the \"Search LinkedIn profiles\" node.\n- Configure the enrichment Apify actor/input in the \"Enrich profiles with emails\" node so it receives the collected profile URLs.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the target spreadsheet, sheet, and column mapping in the \"Append leads to Google Sheets\" node.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the LinkedIn search criteria, enrichment fields, and Google Sheets column mapping to match the target lead list and desired output format."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
